column5:
I feel like she's escorting me, and I should follow her.{w}
Could it be that she's been tasked with my protection?{w}
I grasp at the straws that are the memories in my mind.{w}
I'm only able to latch onto one. It's the title that I go by.

column6:
我感觉她在护送我，我应该跟上她。{w}
难道她的任务就是保护我？{w}
我拼命抓住脑海中那些记忆的稻草。{w}
可我唯一能抓住的，只有我所背负的那个头衔。

column5:
We nod, and make our way out of The Grand Tree.{w}
I smile softly, as this knowledge would be invaluable.{w}
We had probable cause of the attack, {i}and{/i} knew Mylus' involvement.{w}
As soon as I woke up, I'd have everything I needed to help Valinorth.

column6:
我们点点头，动身离开巨树。{w}
我微微一笑，因为这些情报价值连城。{w}
我们找到了袭击的可能缘由，{i}还{/i}知道了迈勒斯的牵涉。{w}
只要我一醒来，就有了拯救瓦利诺斯所需的一切。
